"In this case the module is enabled by adding "
"``CFLAGS_EXTRA=-DMODULE_CEXAMPLE_ENABLED=1`` to the ``make`` command, or "
"editing ``mpconfigport.h`` or ``mpconfigboard.h`` to add"
msgstr ""
